      "linkId": "screen-intro",
      "text": "Introductory script: “Now I’m going to ask you some questions that we ask everyone treated here, no matter what problem they are here for. It is part of the hospital’s policy and it helps us to make sure we are not missing anything important.” Ask items 1–3 exactly as worded; if item 3 is Yes, ask item 3a.",
      "type": "display"
